{"id":"64d508412cdc602b","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-analytic-formula-closure.md","title":"一阶子公式与自由实例闭包","display":"df-analytic-formula-closure — 一阶子公式与自由实例闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-analytic-formula-closure","aliases":["72-df-analytic-formula-closure"],"display":"df-analytic-formula-closure — 一阶子公式与自由实例闭包","depends_on":["[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.1, print22–25/PDF34–37; §2.4–2.5, print36–58/PDF48–70; local closure construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记","review_2026_10_23":"对子公式和自由实例闭包补入α闭包"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-analytic-formula-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-analytic-formula-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analytic-formula-closure — 一阶子公式与自由实例闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1844f67828428aae\" href=\"?note=1844f67828428aae\" title=\"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence\">72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.1, print22–25/PDF34–37; §2.4–2.5, print36–58/PDF48–70; local closure construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"对子公式和自由实例闭包补入α闭包"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定本册扩充语法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}\\)</span> 与部分自由代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B[t/x]\">\\(B[t/x]\\)</span>，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X_\\Sigma\">\\(S\\subseteq X_\\Sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。下列闭包只用合法的自由代入，不隐含对原始字符串的任意替换。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 是同一签名的项集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\\)</span> 使用该语法定义的合法性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1844f67828428aae\" href=\"?note=1844f67828428aae\" title=\"72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence\">72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence</a>，按绑定结构相等定义；它不包括一般语义等价公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC_0(S)&amp;:=S,\\\\\nC_{n+1}(S)&amp;:=C_n(S)\\cup\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma(C_n(S))\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in C_n(S)}\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{B[t/x]:B\\in C_n(S),\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\ x\\in V,\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,B)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}C_n(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC_0(S)&amp;:=S,\\\\\nC_{n+1}(S)&amp;:=C_n(S)\\cup\\operatorname{AlphaCl}_\\Sigma(C_n(S))\\cup\\bigcup_{B\\in C_n(S)}\\operatorname{Sf}_{72}(B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{B[t/x]:B\\in C_n(S),\\ t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\ x\\in V,\\ \\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,B)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}C_n(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S)\\subseteq X_\\Sigma,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S))=\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\subseteq\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S)\\subseteq X_\\Sigma,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S))=\\operatorname{An}_\\Sigma(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书一阶子公式讨论的本地闭包接口。每个有限构造只用有限多个阶段，故阶段并对子公式和合法代入封闭；任何同时封闭的超集都逐阶段包含它，给出最小性与幂等性。此闭包通常无限，也没有给出一阶逻辑的有限判定程序。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23：新增α阶段是与实际 AL/AR 规则对应的必要闭包。沿证明边向上通过改名时，前提公式属于结论公式的α闭包；纯命题公式的α闭包只有自身，所以原命题子公式性质不变。原有自由代入仍逐实例检查合法性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","